{
  "name": "Never Lived",
  "description": "Fire that does not die, and now something that never lived. The End. She says it without irony.",
  "chapter": "zarp:beyond",
  "order": 1,
  "requires": [
    "zarp:living_fire"
  ],
  "giver": {
    "type": "npc",
    "name": "-",
    "of": "zarp:the_camp"
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "text": "Find the portal under the stronghold. Go through. Do not look down.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "place",
          "label": "the End",
          "dimension": "minecraft:the_end"
        }
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        {
          "type": "flag",
          "name": "zarp_beyond_begun",
          "player": false,
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Four end rods and a bottle of the dragon's breath. She was specific.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "collect",
          "item": "minecraft:end_rod",
          "count": 4,
          "consume": true
        },
        {
          "type": "collect",
          "item": "minecraft:dragon_breath",
          "count": 1,
          "consume": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beyond the islands there are cities. Something in one of them was never alive to begin with.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "place",
          "label": "an End city",
          "structure": "minecraft:end_city",
          "dimension": "minecraft:the_end"
        }
      ],
      "on_complete": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "count": 1,
          "radius": 6,
          "genus": "zarp:hollow_knight",
          "entity": "minecraft:enderman",
          "name": "&5The Hollow Knight",
          "tag": "knight",
          "health": 140
        },
        {
          "type": "title",
          "title": "&5&lThe Hollow Knight",
          "subtitle": "&7Empty armour. It moves anyway."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hollow Knight. Take what it leaves.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "kill",
          "target": [
            "zarp:hollow_knight",
            "minecraft:enderman"
          ],
          "count": 1,
          "tag": "knight",
          "drop": {
            "quest_item": "zarp:void_shard",
            "chance": 1.0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Home. The horde is at the fence -- and it is not attacking. It stands. Every head turned to your pack, to the sample from the first bed. Patient Zero wants it back.",
      "on_enter": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "title": "&5&lThey are waiting",
          "subtitle": "&7Not attacking. Waiting."
        },
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "count": 8,
          "radius": 14,
          "entity": "minecraft:zombie",
          "equipment": {
            "head": "minecraft:leather_helmet"
          },
          "genus": "zombiemod:walker"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Give it back",
          "text": "You walk to the fence. Nothing moves. You set the sample down.",
          "next": 6
        },
        {
          "label": "Keep it. Let them come.",
          "text": "You close the pack. Somewhere past the fence, something very old draws breath.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "name": "zarp_kept_sample",
              "player": true,
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "karma",
              "delta": -5
            }
          ],
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave the Origin Sample at the fence and step back.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "collect",
          "quest_item": "zarp:origin_sample",
          "count": 1,
          "consume": true
        }
      ],
      "on_complete": [
        {
          "type": "flag",
          "name": "zarp_truce",
          "player": false,
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "message",
          "text": "&7The horde turns. One by one, then all at once, they walk away into the dark. They do not come back. Not tonight. Maybe not ever.",
          "action_bar": false
        },
        {
          "type": "npc_say",
          "text": "&7...Well. That's one kind of cure.",
          "radius": 16.0,
          "quest": "zarp:the_camp"
        }
      ],
      "ending": "truce"
    }
  ],
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "xp",
      "amount": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "money",
      "amount": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "reputation",
      "standing": "camp",
      "delta": 15
    }
  ],
  "locked": "&fOkafor: 'One impossible thing at a time. Fire first.'"
}